-*   $L_k(\mathbf{l})$ is the $k$-th Spherical Gaussian representing incident radiance [S1, unofficial].
-*   $(\mathbf{n} \cdot \mathbf{l}_k)^+$ denotes the positive part of the dot product (clamped to 0).
